{
  "name": "workflow-command-written-with-yaml-escapes",
  "description": "A workflow step's run command is the value YAML decodes from its scalar: an escape in double quotes, an escaped line break, a plain scalar continued on a more indented line or begun on the line after its key, and a block scalar whose header carries a comment. Each step runs node on the file the decoded command names, so every such file is rooted, nothing they export is reported, and no command is noted. A file no command names is still reported.",
